      "replace_to": "two interaction packets of carrier dimension twelve",
      "proposed_source_line": "The tensor product splits into two interaction packets of carrier dimension twelve. Their total dimension is \\(2\\cdot12=24\\), equal to the product \\(4\\cdot6\\).",
      "status": "recommended_for_next_manuscript_edition"
    },
